   "html": "<p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171743-700x527.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"527\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-39365\" srcset=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171743-700x527.jpg 700w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171743-300x226.jpg 300w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171743-768x578.jpg 768w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171743.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<p>7/18（土）19（日）本八幡駅南口ロータリーで「八幡南口町会 盆踊り大会」が開催されます。</p>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<h2>八幡南口町会 盆踊り大会</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>日程：2026年7月18日（土）19日（日）</li>\n<li>時間：18時〜21時（19日は20時30分）</li>\n<li>場所：本八幡駅南口ロータリー</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171655-482x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"482\" height=\"640\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-39363\" srcset=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171655-482x640.jpg 482w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171655-226x300.jpg 226w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171655-768x1020.jpg 768w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171655.jpg 1054w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" /></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171707-700x527.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"527\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-39364\" srcset=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171707-700x527.jpg 700w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171707-300x226.jpg 300w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171707-768x578.jpg 768w, https://funabashi-tsushin.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_20260715_171707.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<h2>アクセス 本八幡駅</h2>\n<p>場所はこちら。</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1619.5993492876635!2d139.925955721708!3d35.72133152765589!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x601886d06168ac3f%3A0xb1174e1bb1f7cce9!2z5pys5YWr5bmh6aeF!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1784265865235!5m2!1sja!2sjp\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></p>\n<p>こちら読者の方から写真付きで情報提供をいただきました。ありがとうございます。</p>\n<p>関連リンク：<a href=\"https://funabashi-tsushin.com/38972.html\">【2026年】船橋市と近隣で開催される夏まつり・盆踊り・花火大会まとめ</a></p>\n"
